# Skyforge — Act I: The Charter (30 quests, Turn 1a).
# TONE: Steampunk colonial adventure. Foreman of the Skyforge Charter
# arrives on an unclaimed sky-fragment. Optimistic, practical, romantic
# about the work. Reference points: Treasure Planet, Skies of Arcadia.
# THEME BIBLE: Create is the spine. Hand crank -> wooden shaft -> basic
# gears -> Andesite Alloy. Every quest in the Foreman's voice.
# TODO verify all icon + task item IDs at NeoForge 21.1 mod versions.

